WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.778
The platform owner owns the central zones,

3
00:00:03.778 --> 00:00:07.450
their links to the hub, and the
policy that adds zone groups.

4
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.522
Workload owners own their
endpoints and vaults,

5
00:00:10.522 --> 00:00:13.825
and close the public path
once the private one works.

6
00:00:13.825 --> 00:00:18.250
And the application owner keeps each
vault's posture, with the platform owner.

7
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.865
Every read the check makes is Reader,

8
00:00:20.865 --> 00:00:25.100
and it never touches a vault's
data plane: no secrets, no keys.
